391", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_782428476616724_1116172443318779459_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-0LNAVUjh88Q7kNvwHbfC2y&_nc_oc=Ado8-QGupDf3ffAIbihUPlZ35BViVzM-urkY5Ep7SakJoTM9GKo_GGj66zHGRvczuSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2_cWthTLpawt8wT075qBB1f-wves0aNXCtq0Q4_WpTkw&oe=69E8D911"}, {"file_name": "scr_4.png", "id": "159298223794289", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_159298230460955_160499850208589564_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=seheD_0BVCEQ7kNvwGho0gq&_nc_oc=AdqBGlXw5AGhKHDuxXid1l6dSV5jlqMtIVIPSEbVPhV4oJEmORRfY-7M9R3rI-ivhFM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af18fq97wLIoNNsTM_1HbF2wMBzjMKdePZ8jXU4kApFIrA&oe=69E8E0DD"}, {"file_name": "scr_3.png", "id": "1622890074875818", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_1622890078209151_210179435196440368_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N54OaRsa6l0Q7kNvwGExtWB&_nc_oc=AdqJ-xnHfVWsHTkB8qIijsPxD6Crm1A5vstEgWnopGAm8xSXWT4nyT_q9yjDQ955qrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0Ekq1NgwVeZ2yyzgIYECrkO7CKrYnLkj3tMpm9gQ7BjQ&oe=69E8D3B9"}, {"file_name": "scr_2.png", "id": "177703811915843", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_177703815249176_1528287960455225088_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m60T4XSNbqoQ7kNvwHCtW7D&_nc_oc=AdqNiSY-CIlPMfPy2wKwTw6d5bdLNj4lLPGT2EFOOYdZVR4CAdCFWNUTy7hrvMoImC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3OzVa8YR9IAnaUZcHHF0aL-7XE8nCJJYOu8XpfJ-M0Pg&oe=69E8C20A"}, {"file_name": "scr_5.png", "id": "808935813774196", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031332_808935817107529_8861221418933832083_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WwnvOY2UxN0Q7kNvwGjDOrp&_nc_oc=AdoSW2pK-EG_6cLs2R_giJVCOK65rViJKBdih8M9jSA91ZcZH-tZ8zHw6zfE5nW1A5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1biWUfr15OjMkhYnQtkb1SWTZlYsQGgBnP0lksuxdMpA&oe=69E8C2DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The king is gone", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In this game, you have to run away. Different doors are blocking the way, that need to be unlocked to proceed as fast as possible. Each door will give a different benefit, and a combination of them is the key to succeed .. or fail.\n\nTo open a door, a puzzle is presented, where pieces of a key have to be rotated and merged together to open the door. The further you run, the more difficult the key puzzles become.\n\nThere are three different modes:\n\n* Normal Mode: Score is increasing the more you survive. It decreases the more you stay idle in a room without picking a door. There's a set amount of rooms to complete before reaching the end.\n* Endless Mode: Score increases with each room that is completed. There is no end to the amount of rooms presented.\n* Random Mode: Each door has a specific score as a reward when opened. Rooms and their rewards spawn at random.\n\nThe available benefits from the doors are:\n\n* Green doors: Increase running speed.\n* Purple doors: Increase lock-picking skills, which makes opening new doors easier.\n* Blue doors: Gives extra chances before losing.\n* Brown doors provide no direct benefit, apart from helping complete more rooms.", "short_description": "A puzzle game about running, not because one has somewhere to be, but because one has somewhere they don't want to be."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://afloofdev.com/privacy_policy/games/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Afloofdev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.afloofdev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "37